.DS_Store
# .env.local IS ignored — it holds real secrets (Vercel Blob token).
# Never commit it. Older note below is superseded.
# NOTE: .env.local is intentionally NOT ignored here so the beginner
# "git add . → push → Vercel" flow just works. All values inside are
# NEXT_PUBLIC (browser-visible by design). If you ever add a real
# secret, move it to Vercel env vars and add .env.local below.
.vercel
.env*

.env*
